<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 24.5pt">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 24.5pt">The undersigned hereby certifies that the Rights
evidenced by this Right Certificate are not, and never have been, Beneficially Owned by, and are not being sold, transferred or assigned
